      "content": "Do not purchase it if u wall under restricted regions set by the publisher \"Prime Matter / PLAION\", cause the key will fail to activate. Check what region you are before purchasing. \n\nRestricted regions are: \n\nLatin America (LATAM), Southeast Asia (SEA), Eastern Europe / Balkans / CIS, China, Africa;"
