      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/32080156-1788249708.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Awesome game and love the new game mechanics and how they blend the new with the old, tons of customization option for how you want to play...just could use more ccharacters 2 or 3 more new characters and some movement updates for some of the older characters, such running. But all & all, a solid 4 ⭐️ game!"
